"Remove AB3 contact email from About Us","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-07T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"94ee2985d337b56f36360097d3ab0e2bfba421bf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add guardian contact value objects","messageBody":"Poco Book has no dedicated value objects for guardian contact details.\nThe add-student feature needs validated guardian values before parser,\nstorage, and UI integration.\n\nAdd immutable guardian name and phone objects with normalized storage.\nPreserve name capitalization for display and ignore case in equality,\nwith consistent hashing. Require eight phone digits starting with 6, 8,\nor 9, and remove spaces and hyphens before storage.\n\nFollow the submitted MVP rules and error messages so later integration\ncan rely on one validation contract. Cover invalid inputs, boundaries,\nnormalization, Unicode case variants, and equality with unit tests.\n\nValidation: ./gradlew check passes all 252 tests and Checkstyle.\n\nRefs: #25\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":164,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":166,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"2125118c90e0f34b7340ed870725779b50f1d4b6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027up/master\u0027 into 25-guardian-contact","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"5d63e04f0fa6defbc55b43740728fb4cf354da7a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #63 from Suki899/25-guardian-contact","messageBody":"Add guardian contact value objects","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"58dbe8233e68c332f7bd15f3cf0fef1bae8dd4be","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #65 from yiilinzhang/28-find-regression-tests","messageBody":"Add regression tests for find and filtered-list indexes","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"yiilinzhang":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"f966a90a21e5b5451bc4a1815bab56781f92c1bc","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update yiilinzhang\u0027s about us","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"2215707a157d8739c7261f45b655713c26ea94d7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #31 from shiverin/19-aboutus-details","messageBody":"Add Zhao Shizhen\u0027s AboutUs details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"975a1379a26795081d9c74dc660c1825bda2b539","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #42 from suvan1911/13-aboutus-details","messageBody":"Add Suvan Handa\u0027s AboutUs details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"bfc83ec17c681cfd22b87dc90fb07d8825708d9e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #43 from EL-NAIT/profile-photo","messageBody":"Add EL-NAIT\u0027s profile photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"37c5192f1ff18ae66832e9364f986ee453a6b438","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #44 from EL-NAIT/aboutus-details","messageBody":"Update EL-NAIT\u0027s AboutUs details","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"d8c605e765d5e3f1d71f6276b4ee012123bda8eb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update DG target user, value proposition and user stories","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":21,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"321f0a6db53db19fae7f16cae000066ad30d9a40","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add more details to developer guide","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":33,"deletions":20}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e6a573735837da0ba68c653734feb0e1f1271359","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add regression tests for find and filtered-list indexes","messageBody":"Find matching rules and index resolution after a find had little\ntest coverage, so later MVP changes could break them unnoticed.\n\nLet\u0027s add FindCommandTest cases for single, multiple, case-insensitive,\npartial-word, zero-match and result-order behaviour, plus an\nintegration test showing that delete after find uses the index in the\nfiltered list.\n\nNo production change is needed; current behaviour meets the spec.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":134,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"62d92c200cc65fff2b50a6f80002a29147297bba","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use student wording in find and delete messages","messageBody":"The app manages students, but find and delete still reported results\nin terms of \u0027persons\u0027, which does not match the product or issue #3\u0027s\nrequirement that find states the number of students listed.\n\nLet\u0027s update the result, error and usage messages for find and delete,\nand reuse the existing student index error message (as view does).\nConstant names are kept so existing references stay valid.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":8,"deletions":8},"docs":{"insertions":9,"deletions":9},"test-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"912793500cb86d4db745efd9647d406c6daca6f1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Decouple find integration test from index error wording","messageBody":"PR #67 changes delete\u0027s invalid-index error from the person message to\nthe student message. Asserting the exact text here would make this test\nfail whichever of the two PRs merges second.\n\nLet\u0027s assert only the exception type and that no data changed, leaving\nthe exact error text to DeleteCommandTest.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":7,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"a9ab0a5432205708604c0ad09aa50fdd38ad7c43","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #67 from yiilinzhang/3-student-wording-find-delete","messageBody":"Use student wording in find and delete messages","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"suvan1911":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"7cda0cb10e40aabbdc4a49eff3a26846395fbf82","isMergeCommit":f